Movement culture, part of what makes it so effective is that it is simultaneously

00:10.600 --> 00:19.000
drawing from the past of everyone who's done versions of that thing and also

00:19.000 --> 00:25.200
creating something that makes it both specific to the moment and points it in

00:25.200 --> 00:36.760
in another direction and so you know the I think the easiest like within the

00:36.760 --> 00:44.560
realm of fine art things are valorized because of newness this sort of idea of

00:44.560 --> 00:52.240
something being like unique or new or special or creating some sort of

00:52.240 --> 00:58.000
like individuated sublime experience and then within the realm of design

00:58.000 --> 01:05.240
things are valorized based on like there are fact largely at I mean what we

01:05.240 --> 01:12.040
